; The Digital Credentials spec defines digitalCredentials.SetVirtualWalletBehavior but no
; DigitalCredentialsCommand aggregate, which is the only way generation discovers a command.
; Delete once the spec adds the aggregate and the pinned webref carries it.
; https://github.com/w3c-fedid/digital-credentials
DigitalCredentialsCommand = (
  digitalCredentials.SetVirtualWalletBehavior
)
